The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository. It does not
cover everything shipped with it:

Lake outlines under `data/` are derived from OpenStreetMap and are licensed
under the Open Database License (ODbL) by OpenStreetMap contributors, not under
the MIT licence above. `data/lake-dunmore.json` comes from OSM relation 216439.
If you redistribute or build on that data, ODbL applies to it: keep the
attribution, and keep derivatives of the data open.
See https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Forecast data is retrieved at runtime from the US National Weather Service, a
work of the US federal government, and is in the public domain. None of it is
stored in this repository apart from one saved API response used as a test
fixture.
